{
  "abstract": "For n >= 1 let a(n) = Sum_{k=0}^{n-1} C(n, k) C(n-1, k) C(n+k-1, k)^2 and a(0) = 1 (OEIS A212334). This package gives original machine-checked proofs of both of Peter Bala's open supercongruence conjectures on a(n): a(p) ≡ 1 (mod p^5) for every prime p >= 5 (conjecture_1, Dec 12, 2021), and a(p^r) ≡ a(p^{r-1}) (mod p^{3r+3}) for every prime p >= 5 and integer r >= 2 (conjecture_2, Oct 13, 2022).",
